WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.586 --> 00:00:02.019
SCOTT LANG
A lot has changed about my life.

00:00:04.017 --> 00:00:06.031
We literally saved the world.

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:11.328
But right now, the only
job I want is being a dad.

00:00:12.027 --> 00:00:13.521
♪♪

00:00:13.572 --> 00:00:14.581
KANG THE CONQUEROR
Scott Lang...

00:00:14.961 --> 00:00:16.450
You want to get out of here...

00:00:17.085 --> 00:00:20.270
...and I need to get out of here.

00:00:20.969 --> 00:00:22.322
Bring me what I want.

00:00:22.373 --> 00:00:23.173
SCOTT LANG
What's that?

00:00:24.249 --> 00:00:26.606
♪ When are you gonna come down? ♪

00:00:26.657 --> 00:00:27.992
JANET VAN DYNE
You cannot trust him.

00:00:28.042 --> 00:00:30.004
♪ When are you going to land? ♪

00:00:30.055 --> 00:00:31.957
SCOTT LANG
I don't care who this guy is.

00:00:32.007 --> 00:00:33.092
I just lost so much time.

00:00:33.143 --> 00:00:36.970
♪ Oh, I've finally decided my future lies ♫

00:00:37.021 --> 00:00:40.225
JANET VAN DYNE
He's a monster who thinks he's a god.

00:00:40.275 --> 00:00:41.623
♪♪

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.007
KANG THE CONQUEROR
Everything you call a life...

00:00:44.058 --> 00:00:44.897
CASSIE LANG
Dad!

00:00:45.668 --> 00:00:47.973
KANG THE CONQUEROR
...I will burn out of time.

00:00:48.024 --> 00:00:48.981
[Screaming]

00:00:49.032 --> 00:00:49.681
SCOTT LANG
He's got Cassie.

00:00:49.731 --> 00:00:51.026
HOPE VAN DYNE
We'll stop him together.

00:00:52.141 --> 00:00:53.988
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You think you can beat me?

00:00:54.038 --> 00:00:55.189
[Screaming]

